    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099750/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1743023628\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099750/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1743023628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099750/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1743023628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099750/extras/587489f405e01f6fe1747e34f798cb57.poster.avif?t=1743023628\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099750/extras/587489f405e01f6fe1747e34f798cb57.webm?t=1743023628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099750/extras/587489f405e01f6fe1747e34f798cb57.mp4?t=1743023628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something happened on the way to FANKY TOWN..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GOD PLEASE HELP ME</strong> is the story-driven roguelike program with horror elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HOT BLEND OF 8-BIT, 64-BIT AND MS PAINT ART STYLE GRAPHICS </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every game session is unique!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PLEASE</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smooth animations!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GOD</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Royal soundesign!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4K!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HELP</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You will:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your speed by rushing straight ahead, jump, slide and turn into orange liquid to avoid and destroy obstacles!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy upgrades, fight bosses, collect and search for creatures and food!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remain calm and keep focus! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099750/extras/835696147b2fbdc7f5877e6e45df785d.poster.avif?t=1743023628\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099750/extras/835696147b2fbdc7f5877e6e45df785d.webm?t=1743023628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099750/extras/835696147b2fbdc7f5877e6e45df785d.mp4?t=1743023628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
